==Description==
The '''GreenSlime Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 7 of the premium [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|130}} or {{Robux|56}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|480}} or {{Robux|272}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|71}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Robux|345}}.

The '''GreenSlime Nametag''' has green gradient text with a dark green outline. Multiple splashes and slime drops come out of the text.

